{"results": [{"id": "hp_doc_7299b379f547eb4d4d7acbabf2c75f0342a10c55e118e56ca97332b352adade4", "title": "O'Sheas Casino", "text": "O'Sheas Casino is a casino located within The Linq on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada. As part of The Linq, it is owned and operated by Caesars Entertainment Corporation and is connected on the exterior to a shopping/dining promenade, also owned by Caesars. The revitalized O'Sheas has three bars - the main Dublin Up Bar, the Lucky Bar and the exterior-facing Blarney Bar. The casino includes beer pong tables, a stage, a dance floor and a pit with games including blackjack, roulette, and craps.", "score": 34.7374}, {"id": "hp_doc_ebde3472137ddd6202fa9fe674aba542882d118ee1a4d1c1671051c68f935111", "title": "Klondike Hotel and Casino", "text": "Klondike Hotel and Casino (formerly Kona Kai Motel and Klondike Inn) was a 153-room hotel and a 7700 sqft casino on the Las Vegas Strip in Paradise, Nevada, in the United States.", "score": 25.9713}, {"id": "hp_doc_b0c499eace1918a7cb2c86fee28bff83b66dff675c808abfb1455b64bf2369b1", "title": "Gold Coast Hotel and Casino", "text": "The Gold Coast Hotel & Casino is a hotel and casino located in Paradise, Nevada. This locals' casino is owned and operated by Boyd Gaming. The Gold Coast is located one mile (1.6 km) west of the Las Vegas Strip on West Flamingo Road. It is located across the street from the Palms Casino Resort and the Rio All Suite Hotel and Casino.", "score": 24.0499}], "remaining_searches": 2}
